o\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-52\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"448cc923-2040-4f2b-a186-d02e08aefa10\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\">\n<h5 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"288\">Our Sendahl Natural Body Oil hydrates, softens, and smooths with lasting nourishment. Infused with Vitamin\u202fE to protect against environmental stress, its lightweight formula absorbs easily\u2014scented with grounding notes of sandalwood to leave skin visibly more radiant and deeply cared for.</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<h5>The Sendahl Body Oil is made with 100% natural ingredients and is free of parabens and phthalates.</h5>", "published_at": "2025-04-14T23:26:07-05:00", "created_at": "2023-11-11T00:17:19-06:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T10:43:47-05:00", "vendor": "Pasaj Perfume", "product_type": "Body Oil", "tags": ["Body", "Gifts", "Men", "Skincare"], "variants": [{"id": 40702518722