s shadowed forests and still embers. Earthy clove leaf and smoky cade unfold into warm cedar and oud, accented by patchouli and vetiver for a rich, meditative atmosphere.</h5>\n<h5>Our Ooude perfumed candle is made with natural soy wax and is free of parabens and phthalates.</h5>", "published_at": "2024-11-18T12:43:21-06:00", "created_at": "2024-10-19T22:36:10-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T10:43:47-05:00", "vendor": "Pasaj Perfume", "product_type": "Candle", "tags": ["Gifts", "Men"], "variants": [{"id": 42342557614168, "title": "255 g", "option1": "255 g", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": "", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "64.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 8163076243544, "created_at": "2024-10-19T22:36:11-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T10:43:47-05:00"}], "images": [{"id": 45308300984408, "created_at": "2026-08-07T17:15:43-05:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-07T17:15:45-05:00", "product_id": 8163076243544, "variant_ids": [], "src": "/assets/97fd64642d79-Ooude_d2fd41d2-a852-46f0-ba8d-060a8625a4c1.jpg", "width": 2000, "height": 2000}, {"id": 45507989700696, "created_at": "2026-08-25T18:56:43-05:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-08-25T18:56:44-05:00", "product_id": 8163076243544, "variant_ids": [], "src": "/assets/89584899557b-Candles_-_Ooude.png", "width": 800, "height": 800}, {"id": 34345935831128, "created_at": "2025-01-21T15:47:47-06:00", "position": 3, "updated_at": "2025-01-27T07:35:04-06:00", "product_id": 8163076243544, "variant_ids": [], "src": "/assets/548b0003d9e3-ooude.jpg", "width": 3795, "height": 3795}, {"id": 34372385439832, "created_at": "2025-01-27T07:34:29-06:00", "position": 4, "updated_at": "2026-04-12T16:21:29-05:00", "product_id": 8163076243544, "variant_ids": [], "src": "/assets/9acd1de4514f-ooude_candle_packaging_square.jpg", "width": 3600, "height": 3600}], "options": [{"name": "Size", "position": 1, "values"